      "summary": "This OpenStax textbook introduces the governing principles of computer science, outlining core concepts, governing rules, and applications. The text is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution Non-Commercial ShareAlike 4.0 International License, allowing non-commercial sharing and adaptation. Proper attribution is required for any use or adaptation of the material.",
