          "topic": "Introduction to",
          "question": "What is the key concept in computer science?",
          "answer": "• Key Takeaway: The key concept in computer science is the understanding of algorithms and data structures.\n• Mechanism: Algorithms are used to solve problems and data structures are used to organize and store data.\n• Common Pitfall: Failing to understand the time and space complexity of algorithms can lead to inefficient code."
        },
        {
          "id": "c1_3_b958",
          "topic": "Introduction to",
          "question": "What is the definition of computer science?",
          "answer": "• Definition: Computer science is the study of the theory, design, and implementation of computer systems and programs.\n• Mathematical/Physical Intuition: Computer science is based on the principles of mathematics and physics.\n• Impact: The impact of computer science is felt in many areas of life, from technology to healthcare and education."
