      "summary": "This section discusses the importance of computational thinking in various industries, including DNA sequencing, and highlights its key principles and applications. It emphasizes the need for decomposition, pattern recognition, abstraction, algorithms, logical thinking, evaluation, and debugging. The section also provides practical examples of how computational thinking can be applied to real-world problems.",
      "objectives": [
        "Understand the principles of computational thinking and its applications in different industries",
        "Apply decomposition, pattern recognition, and abstraction to solve complex problems",
